        <mxCell id="compare-table" value="" style="shape=table;startSize=30;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fixedRows=1;rowLines=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="200" y="870" width="1000" height="180" as="geometry" />
